      "content": "thanks for the info!! but u mentioned newham and stratford being a bit sketchier... is that because of the demographics there? like, i noticed those areas are way more immigrant-heavy/diverse than places like Chelsea or Kensington. is it basically just a case of more diversity meaning more crime/sketchiness, or am i misinterpreting that? just trying to gauge if \"vibrant/diverse\" always comes with a safety trade-off in london.",
